# Second input graph for CatholicOS__ontokit-api__ontokit_services_linter.py__OntologyLinter__check_orphan_class
# (added by the repair of 2026-10-30).
#
# In fixture.ttl owl:Thing has a child (ex:OrphanThingOnly), so it is not an
# orphan whatever the `class_uri == owl_thing` skip does. Here owl:Thing is
# typed owl:Class and has neither parent nor child: only that skip keeps it
# out of the result. ex:Alone is the one orphan that must be reported.
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

owl:Thing a owl:Class .
ex:Alone a owl:Class .
